aramas pwe ka ekieki usun,","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"nge met aüchean nöün aramas pwe ka tümwünü?","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"Nge ka föri i pwe epwe ekis kis fomw en ai Kot,","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ka ämwärämwära ngeni ling me iteüöch.","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"Ka awisa ngeni pwe epwe nemeni mettoch meinisin ka föri.","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"Ka anomu fän nemenian föriom kewe meinisin,","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ekewe sip me ekewe kow meinisin, pwal ekewe manmwachon lemäl,","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ekewe mansüsü me ekewe ikenen leset","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"me sokopaten mönün leset.","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":[{"text":"Äm Samol mi Lapalap, äm Samol,","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"a fokun pwäla iteüöchum won unusen fanüfan!","poem":1}]}],"footnotes":[]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/chk_bsm/PSA/8.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/chk_bsm/PSA/9.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/chk_bsm/PSA/7.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":9}